# Intentionally TRACKED in this repository:
# models/*.keras          - six trained neural networks
# models/*.json           - label mapping and training history
# data/processed/*.csv    - dataset manifest and feature comparisons
# data/processed/*.json   - label mapping
# results/**/*.csv        - evaluation metrics
# results/**/*.png        - confusion matrices and training curves
# notebooks/*.ipynb       - reproducible experiments
